/*  A helper makes a series and stores it in the one it is given.
    Obligation broken: O4, what a function stores into its parameters is its caller's business. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Bind void to push-into, given (the series of series of number bag):
    Define fresh as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    Insert fresh into bag.
Done.
Define keeper as a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Cast push-into on (keeper).
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State keeper.
